# Stack Template

Purpose:
  Generic template for technology stack selection.

Owns: templates\_sdd\stack\LAYER.template.sdd
Instructions:
  Replace placeholders with actual tech choices for each layer.

Template:
  Stack: {LAYER_NAME}

  Language: {language} {version}
  Framework: {framework}
  Architecture: {architecture pattern}

  Layers:
    - {layer 1}/      # {description}
    - {layer 2}/     # {description}
    - {layer 3}/   # {description}
    - {layer 4}/  # {description}

  Skills:
    - {skill path 1}
    - {skill path 2}

  Rationale:
    {Why these choices}


State: +

